              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atakagwisize, eiraka lyema omw'iguru n'amani liti, “Iwe Mukama Nebukadineza, tokili Mukama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abantu barakubinga ogende kutura n'enyamaishwa omw'irungu. Oralya obunyasi nk'ente emyaka mushanju kuhika orwo olimanya okwo obukama bw'abantu butabuka ahali Rushoborabyona, kandi abuha owo yagonza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
