            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo ekyo kigobelera bwangu bwangu ahali Nebukadineza, embaga emushenda, alya obunyasi nk'ente. Aralilirwa orume, eishokelye liraihya nk'ebishanda by'enkwaju, empambo zimushusha ez'amahungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
