        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza kayabaire nabarura agamba ati, “Ebiro kabyahoire nainunura amaisho omw'iguru, nashuba nagira amagezi, nasingiza Rukirabyona, muhaisiliza, mukunisa okwo abaho eirai lyona, nti,",
