        {
          "text": "“Nigo makiro gonene gonene orwo nashubire kugira amagezi, nirwo engoma yange n'ekitinwa n'oburungi bwayo n'obukama bwange byangarukiire. Abaramata bange n'abami bangarukaho, aho engoma yange eguma, ngira ekitinwa ekishagireho. ",
          "type": "text",
